{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22369","headline":"秋霁 · 白居易","name":"秋霁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金火不相待，炎凉雨中变。\n林晴有残蝉，巢冷无留燕。\n沈吟卷长簟，怆恻收团扇。\n向夕稍无泥，闲步青苔院。\n月出砧杵动，家家捣秋练。\n独对多病妻，不能理鍼线。\n冬衣殊未制，夏服行将绽。\n何以迎早秋，一杯聊自劝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22369.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22369","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}